<section class="page-hero page-hero-compact"><div class="shell page-hero-grid"><div><span class="mono-label">CUSTOMER ACCOUNTS / DATABASE</span><h1>Customer accounts</h1></div><p>Customer records loaded from the LabDesk POS database.</p></div></section>
